                                "sense_id": "3c692f9a-0c49-32bb-a9da-63df0458aa2b",
                                "text": "Wordle is a seemingly simple puzzle, giving users six tries to guess a five-letter word that resets every day."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ffe7e55c-b8fb-4367-9eb8-b26ea4de9180",
                                "sense_id": "3c692f9a-0c49-32bb-a9da-63df0458aa2b",
                                "text": "Fourteen months on from the NYT's acquisition of Wordle, some players remain keen enough on the game to supplement their daily fix with similar puzzles such as Quordle, Heardle and Worldle."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
